 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "All five old kinds kept; four new kinds added as planned (banknote album, sticker album, cover and postcard album, coin cabinet). Coin folder is a type of coin album; Whitman editions as versions. Old Leuchtturm coin-album models and ranges (CLASSIC GRANDE, PRESSO, KASKADE, NUMIS, VISTA) became versions of the Leuchtturm coin album; old Ultra PRO binders became PRO-BINDER versions. Lindner banknote album, Lindner/Leuchtturm FDC lines and Scott Specialty start date left out (no fetched page). The Vario F banknote album page did not name its maker, so the maker is blank. Davo, Stanley Gibbons and Ultra PRO brand entries from knowledge; several retailer pages returned 403 and were retried via Firecrawl."
}